<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">The fly-tip script</h3>

<div class="govuk-inset-text">
  <p class="govuk-body">Dial the number again. When the bot greets you, say:</p>
  <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-font-style-italic">
    "There's a load of rubbish been dumped in the alley behind my house. It's been there since the weekend. Mattresses, bin bags, the lot."
  </p>
</div>

<p class="govuk-body">The bot says something like:</p>

<div class="govuk-inset-text">
  <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-font-style-italic">
    "Thanks for reporting that. Could you send a photo? You can upload one right now through the WhatsApp, iMessage or RCS simulator on the right of the companion app. I'll wait."
  </p>
</div>

<p class="govuk-body">The line holds. The contact flow has dropped you into a long-poll branch that waits for the photo. You don't hang up; you upload.</p>

<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Download a photo to use</h3>

<div class="ndx-photo-download">
  <img src="/assets/downloads/sample-flytip.jpg"
